    <item>
      <title>AI「打工人」天花板？TRAE SOLO：从“写代码”到“全自动交付”，开发者要“躺平”了？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aitrae-solo-20250723104005362-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Jul 2025 10:40:05 +0800</pubDate>
